- How would you simulate network partitions and validate reconnect/backoff behavior across regions?
- How would you validate exactly-once semantics when an event is replayed during backfill?

## Why This Is Asked

Assess ability to design end-to-end API tests for dynamic feature flags and multi-region consistency under outages.

## Key Concepts

